          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is locked. Authenticate with %@ to continue."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app está bloqueada. Autentícate con %@ para continuar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app est verrouillée. Authentifiez-vous avec %@ pour continuer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用已锁定。请使用 %@ 验证以继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La connessione con %@ si è chiusa. L'app si riconnetterà da sola.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انقطع الاتصال بـ %@. سيعيد التطبيق الاتصال تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung zu %@ wurde geschlossen. Die App verbindet sich von selbst neu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection to %@ was closed. The app will reconnect by itself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conexión con %@ se ha cerrado. La app se reconectará sola."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion à %@ s'est fermée. L'app se reconnectera d'elle-même."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 %@ 的连接已关闭。App 会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La sincronizzazione iCloud richiede la build firmata ufficiale (DMG dal sito, Homebrew o Mac App Store): questa copia non ha il profilo iCloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تتطلب مزامنة iCloud الإصدار الرسمي الموقّع (DMG من الموقع أو Homebrew أو Mac App Store): هذه النسخة لا تحتوي على ملف تعريف iCloud."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die iCloud-Synchronisierung erfordert den offiziellen signierten Build (DMG von der Website, Homebrew oder Mac App Store): Diese Kopie hat kein iCloud-Profil."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud sync requires the official signed build (DMG from the website, Homebrew or Mac App Store): this copy has no iCloud profile."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sincronización de iCloud requiere la compilación oficial firmada (DMG del sitio, Homebrew o Mac App Store): esta copia no tiene el perfil de iCloud."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La synchronisation iCloud nécessite la version officielle signée (DMG du site, Homebrew ou Mac App Store) : cette copie n'a pas le profil iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 同步需要官方签名版本（网站 DMG、Homebrew 或 Mac App Store）：此副本没有 iCloud 配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le notifiche (download avviati e completati, server non raggiungibile, cadute e riconnessioni eD2k/Kad) si gestiscono in Impostazioni di Sistema → Notifiche: la riga Notifiche ti porta lì.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُدار الإشعارات (بدء التنزيلات وإكمالها، وعدم الوصول إلى الخادم، وانقطاع eD2k/Kad وإعادة اتصالهما) في إعدادات النظام → الإشعارات: يأخذك صف الإشعارات إلى هناك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mitteilungen (gestartete und abgeschlossene Downloads, nicht erreichbarer Server, eD2k/Kad-Abbrüche und -Wiederverbindungen) werden in den Systemeinstellungen → Mitteilungen verwaltet: Die Zeile Mitteilungen führt dich dorthin."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications (downloads started and completed, server unreachable, eD2k/Kad drops and reconnections) are managed in System Settings → Notifications: the Notifications row takes you there."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las notificaciones (descargas iniciadas y completadas, servidor no accesible, caídas y reconexiones eD2k/Kad) se gestionan en Ajustes del Sistema → Notificaciones: la fila Notificaciones te lleva allí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notifications (téléchargements démarrés et terminés, serveur injoignable, coupures et reconnexions eD2k/Kad) se gèrent dans Réglages Système → Notifications : la ligne Notifications vous y amène."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知（下载开始与完成、服务器不可达、eD2k/Kad 断开与重连）在“系统设置 → 通知”中管理：点按“通知”一行即可前往。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le notifiche di aMule Remote sono disattivate nelle Impostazioni del dispositivo. Attivale da Impostazioni → aMule Remote → Notifiche.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إشعارات aMule Remote معطّلة في إعدادات الجهاز. فعّلها من الإعدادات ← aMule Remote ← الإشعارات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Mitteilungen von aMule Remote sind in den Geräteeinstellungen deaktiviert. Aktiviere sie unter Einstellungen → aMule Remote → Mitteilungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aMule Remote notifications are turned off in device Settings. Enable them in Settings → aMule Remote → Notifications."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las notificaciones de aMule Remote están desactivadas en los Ajustes del dispositivo. Actívalas en Ajustes → aMule Remote → Notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notifications d'aMule Remote sont désactivées dans les Réglages de l'appareil. Activez-les dans Réglages → aMule Remote → Notifications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aMule Remote 的通知已在设备设置中关闭。请在“设置 → aMule Remote → 通知”中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le notifiche di aMule Remote sono disattivate nelle Impostazioni di sistema. Attivale da Impostazioni di Sistema → Notifiche → aMule Remote.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إشعارات aMule Remote معطّلة في إعدادات النظام. فعّلها من إعدادات النظام ← الإشعارات ← aMule Remote."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Mitteilungen von aMule Remote sind in den Systemeinstellungen deaktiviert. Aktiviere sie unter Systemeinstellungen → Mitteilungen → aMule Remote."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aMule Remote notifications are turned off in System Settings. Enable them in System Settings → Notifications → aMule Remote."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las notificaciones de aMule Remote están desactivadas en Ajustes del Sistema. Actívalas en Ajustes del Sistema → Notificaciones → aMule Remote."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notifications d'aMule Remote sont désactivées dans les Réglages Système. Activez-les dans Réglages Système → Notifications → aMule Remote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "aMule Remote 的通知已在系统设置中关闭。请在“系统设置 → 通知 → aMule Remote”中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le notifiche sono disattivate nelle Impostazioni di sistema.": {
      "localizations": {
